  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Refugees and Migration programme in Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support displacement-affected people and host communities in marginalised areas of Ethiopia through improved basic social services (including education, health, WASH), livelihoods and vocational training, shelter and protection. Support in areas of outward migration and in response to migration challenges. DFID will also support the deployment of standby/surge personnel for pivotal technical specialist positions as part of emergency responses.</narrative>
  </description>
